{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15101","headline":"溪中月下寄杨子尉封亮 · 李益","name":"溪中月下寄杨子尉封亮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蘅若夺幽色，衔思恍无悰。\n宵长霜雾多，岁晏淮海风。\n团团山中月，三五离夕同。\n露凝朱弦绝，觞至兰玉空。\n清光液流波，盛明难再逢。\n尝恐河汉远，坐窥烟景穷。\n小人谅处阴，君子树大功。\n永愿厉高翼，慰我丹桂丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}